ator": "maxPoolSizeSupplier", "var_name": "maxPoolSizeSupplier"}, {"original_string": "@Nonnull\n   private final TaskRecorder taskRecorder;", "modifier": "@Nonnull\n   private final", "type": "TaskRecorder", "declarator": "taskRecorder", "var_name": "taskRecorder"}, {"original_string": "@Nullable\n   private ApplicationEventPublisher applicationEventPublisher;", "modifier": "@Nullable\n   private", "type": "ApplicationEventPublisher", "declarator": "applicationEventPublisher", "var_name": "applicationEventPublisher"}, {"original_string": "@Nonnull\n   private static final Ordering<AppFactoryTask> metaStatusOrdering =\n         Ordering.natural().onResultOf(new Function<AppFactoryTask, Comparable>() {\n            @SuppressWarnings(\"ReturnOfNull\")\n            @Override\n            public Comparable apply(@Nullable AppFactoryTask input) {\n               return (null == input) ? null\n                                      : input.getCurrentTaskState().getQueueStatus();\n            }\n         }).reverse();", "modifier": "@Nonnull\n   private static final", "type": "Ordering<AppFactoryTask>", "declarator": "metaStatusOrdering =\n         Ordering.natural().onResultOf(new Function<AppFactoryTask, Comparable>() {\n            @SuppressWarnings(\"ReturnOfNull\")\n            @Override\n            public Comparable apply(@Nullable AppFactoryTask input) {\n               return (null == input) ? null\n                                      : input.getCurrentTaskState().getQueueStatus();\n            }\n         }).reverse()", "var_name": "metaStatusOrdering"}, {"original_string": "@Nonnull\n   private static final\n   Ordering<AppFactoryTask>\n         taskIdOrdering =\n         Ordering.natural().onResultOf(new Function<AppFactoryTask, Comparable>() {\n            @SuppressWarnings(\"ReturnOfNull\")\n            @Override\n            public Comparable apply(@Nullable AppFactoryTask input) {\n               return (null == input) ? null\n                             